{
  "meta": {
    "name": "本鸭·精排",
    "source": "handcrafted",
    "notes": "本鸭旗舰精排主题（benya-premium）。在 benya-clean 的品牌绿基调上更精致：章节色块锚点(h2.wrapBefore)、荧光笔下划线小标题(h3 渐变)、关键词浅色下划线(strong)、居中渐变分割线(hr.html)、圆角卡片引用、题图+图注。装饰全部局部化，不用整篇 articleWrap 外壳，降真机风险。占位法铁律：所有纯装饰 section/span(h2.wrapBefore / hr.html) 内部必须保留 <span leaf=\"\"><br></span> 占位，否则公众号编辑器会把空 section 连样式一起 strip——勿手工删。两个派生高亮色(荧光笔 0.20 / 关键词下划线 0.35)是 accent #15a074 的半透明字面 rgba，未占 palette 第 9 key(刻意从简)。strong 只做 paint-only 下划线(无 font-size，避免编辑器 reflow)。li 不设自定义 marker——ul/ol 落回浏览器原生符号（圆点/数字），避免渲染引擎对 ul/ol 一视同仁前缀 marker 导致有序列表出现「1. ▎文本」双标记。自增章节编号/中英双标题需引擎计数器，静态主题做不到——约定作者在标题文本手写(如 ## 01 丨 章节名)。过 validate-theme 全部红线：无 script/style/class/src，style 串不含 <>。"
  },
  "palette": {
    "text": "#2b2f36",
    "heading": "#14181d",
    "accent": "#15a074",
    "accent2": "#0c6f54",
    "muted": "#9aa4ae",
    "bgSoft": "#eef8f3",
    "border": "#e4eae7",
    "link": "#0c6f54"
  },
  "page": {
    "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif",
    "fontSize": "16px",
    "lineHeight": "1.8",
    "letterSpacing": "0.01em",
    "color": "{{text}}"
  },
  "elements": {
    "h1": {
      "style": "font-size:25px;font-weight:800;color:{{heading}};line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:0.01em;margin:6px 0 22px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:3px solid {{accent}};"
    },
    "h2": {
      "wrapBefore": "<section style='margin:40px 0 0;width:34px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:{{accent}};'><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section>",
      "style": "font-size:21px;font-weight:800;color:{{heading}};line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0.01em;margin:12px 0 16px;padding:0 0 10px 14px;border-left:5px solid {{accent}};border-bottom:1px solid {{border}};"
    },
    "h3": {
      "style": "background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 62%,rgba(21,160,116,0.20) 62%);font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:{{accent2}};line-height:1.7;margin:26px 0 12px;display:inline;"
    },
    "h4": {
      "style": "font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:{{heading}};line-height:1.6;margin:20px 0 10px;"
    },
    "p": {
      "style": "margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:{{text}};"
    },
    "ul": {
      "style": "margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;"
    },
    "ol": {
      "style": "margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:24px;"
    },
    "li": {
      "style": "margin:0 0 11px;line-height:1.85;color:{{text}};"
    },
    "blockquote": {
      "style": "margin:22px 0;padding:16px 20px;background:{{bgSoft}};border:1px solid rgba(21,160,116,0.14);border-left:4px solid {{accent}};border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;color:{{text}};font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.85;"
    },
    "img": {
      "style": "max-width:100%;display:block;margin:0 auto;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(18,58,44,0.15);",
      "figureStyle": "margin:26px 0;text-align:center;",
      "captionStyle": "font-size:13px;color:{{muted}};margin-top:12px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.02em;"
    },
    "hr": {
      "html": "<section style='margin:34px auto;width:64px;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(21,160,116,0),{{accent}},rgba(21,160,116,0));'><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section>"
    },
    "strong": {
      "style": "font-weight:700;color:{{accent2}};border-bottom:2px solid rgba(21,160,116,0.35);padding-bottom:1px;"
    },
    "em": {
      "style": "font-style:italic;color:{{accent2}};"
    },
    "del": {
      "style": "text-decoration:line-through;color:{{muted}};"
    },
    "a": {
      "style": "color:{{link}};text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px;font-weight:600;word-break:break-all;"
    },
    "code": {
      "style": "padding:2px 6px;background:{{bgSoft}};border-radius:4px;font-family:'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:14px;color:{{accent2}};"
    },
    "pre": {
      "style": "margin:0 0 18px;padding:16px 18px;background:#f6f8fa;border:1px solid {{border}};border-radius:10px;overflow-x:auto;font-family:'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.7;color:{{text}};white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all;"
    }
  },
  "decorations": {
    "articleWrap": {
      "before": "",
      "after": ""
    },
    "sectionDivider": ""
  }
}
